むしろ自分にも至らない点があると反省している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"協力して今回の件に当たろうとするも、拒絶され戸惑っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"棗と同年齢ではあるが、退魔師としての力は棗よりも強く天才肌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため早い段階で出世し、棗を弟子にするようなレベルとなっているが、精神的にはまだ年相応な部分があるため、現状の解決策を見出せずにいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「九条、私達は協力しなくてはならない」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"51453"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"94 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5915","sourceWorkId":"20207","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"145 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5915","sourceWorkId":"20207","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"80 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5915","sourceWorkId":"20207","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5915","sourceWorkId":"20207","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/30/30ff9d9430de886b050ff21709d996f86adaa2e63986c794e6b08adcc9029ede.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/30/307c259987c4189ab3dd110cbef106c199a0cdcca0776a3b64f82ed38c2146c2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田島 優","creatorId":"vndb:s590","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s590","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s590","name":"いのくち ゆか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:63108","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c29840","characterName":"リミエラ・トリル・エリューシカ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"51454","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"128512"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5916"],"vndbCharacterId":"c29840"},"originalCharacterName":"リミエラ・トリル・エリューシカ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identity